      "title": "Towards an Interoperable Information Infrastructure Providing Decision Support for Genomic Medicine",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>Genetic dispositions play a major role in individual disease risk and treatment response. Genomic medicine, in which medical decisions are refined by genetic information of particular patients, is becoming increasingly important. Here we describe our work and future visions around the creation of a distributed infrastructure for pharmacogenetic data and medical decision support, based on industry standards such as the Web Ontology Language (OWL) and the Arden Syntax.</jats:p>",
